<section class="split-section">
  <div class="split-section__content">
    <div class="section-label">About the Archive</div>
    <h2>THIRTY YEARS OF IMAGES. FOUND NOWHERE ELSE.</h2>
    <p>When Grosby Group began operations, we did not just license photography — we built an archive. Every event covered, every celebrity photographed, every cultural moment documented was catalogued and preserved.</p>
    <p>The result is a body of work that represents three decades of Latin American visual culture. Moments from the region's political history. The celebrities who defined eras. The sporting triumphs that brought countries to a standstill. The social and cultural shifts that changed Latin America.</p>
    <p>This content cannot be found anywhere else. It is available exclusively through Grosby Group — to licensed publishers, editors, and documentary makers who need the historical record.</p>
    <a href="{{ site.archiveUrl }}" class="btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Access the archive →</a>
  </div>
  <div class="split-section__image">
    {% image images.hero.content, "Editorial archive — visual history of Latin America", "(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 40vw" %}
  </div>
</section>

